<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Foster's appoints King to Asia unit.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Foster's appoints King to Asia unit.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foster's Brewing Group Ltd said on Friday it had appointed James King as chief operating officer of the group's Asian operations.</p>
<p>Foster's president and chief executive officer Ted Kunkel said the new position had been created to oversee Foster's expanding role in Asia and that King would be in charge of regional strategic development and based in Melbourne.</p>
<p>King, 45, was previously with Kraft Foods (Asia Pacific), a unit of Philip Morris, where he was president for the last five years based in Hong Kong.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
